{"steam_appid":3419140,"steam_name":"Stickility","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419140/79606696/06639a6dd417f287651d10fbd22efd4d2cf4dd28/1783669909/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783670647","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257374373/5e3ca77fa9719e740b2d3f06197e22c528f28fb5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783670647","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/65516ac13b172a4d5a1a1c72f3352d611395ca93/ss_65516ac13b172a4d5a1a1c72f3352d611395ca93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791306076","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/af870f4c70b3ca9c91ae5822f31aede583bacdf2/ss_af870f4c70b3ca9c91ae5822f31aede583bacdf2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791306076","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/2b844f90881ef675144be4f6402237a5eee8e0a4/ss_2b844f90881ef675144be4f6402237a5eee8e0a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791306076","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/95fb90f7d1bc5d0b7263b14c381d489573dca5f6/ss_95fb90f7d1bc5d0b7263b14c381d489573dca5f6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791306076","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/84edb993c41c5afe359642b2a12aca29b5b564b9/ss_84edb993c41c5afe359642b2a12aca29b5b564b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791306076"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into depths of laboratories and stickmen!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biotec, a shady company suspected of commiting a serious crime behind the curtains, went through several investigations, and yet nothing has been found. Explore the facility's interiors, seeking the truth for yourself, and uncover the secret of the world full of stickmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/aa523bbb30f11524bb8b2d280300b3bd.avif?t=1791306076\" width=1560 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/d5a0cda09cdcf7bafa6eec8ecdd244c0.webp?t=1791306076\" width=1080 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather and Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines traditional metroidvania exploration with crafting mechanics, allowing you to gather resources and create items to aid on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world full of items required to craft new equipment, weapons and additional tools, all of which increase your chances of succeeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/359388261d59e607aed28150a2c9fde8.poster.avif?t=1791306076\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/359388261d59e607aed28150a2c9fde8.webm?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/359388261d59e607aed28150a2c9fde8.mp4?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/d5a0cda09cdcf7bafa6eec8ecdd244c0.webp?t=1791306076\" width=1080 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flashy, acrobatic combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your gameplay with different tools and weapons, each presenting different playstyle and possibilities. Survival-style menu design allows for quick item switching, letting you change your weapon set mid-fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/49b047ed3f9127e790bbc2c2b91397ea.poster.avif?t=1791306076\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/49b047ed3f9127e790bbc2c2b91397ea.webm?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/49b047ed3f9127e790bbc2c2b91397ea.mp4?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/d5a0cda09cdcf7bafa6eec8ecdd244c0.webp?t=1791306076\" width=1080 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover various biomes and environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biotec's facility is full of smokey laboratories, atmospheric server halls, large warehouses, smelly sewer systems, lively greenhouses, vast caves, and more! Explore each and every location, discovering its' secrets and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/6f877add376cf8cb6bdb8ad1c849bc21.poster.avif?t=1791306076\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/6f877add376cf8cb6bdb8ad1c849bc21.webm?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/6f877add376cf8cb6bdb8ad1c849bc21.mp4?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/d5a0cda09cdcf7bafa6eec8ecdd244c0.webp?t=1791306076\" width=1080 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face large variety of foes and bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neutral scientists, to killing machines, Biotec is full of dangerous foes that all lay as an obstacle on your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/18fc4dfeae468ebc2c68f9151a71e09a.poster.avif?t=1791306076\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/18fc4dfeae468ebc2c68f9151a71e09a.webm?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/18fc4dfeae468ebc2c68f9151a71e09a.mp4?t=1791306076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old-school Flash games' style and characters, combines into a fun and (somewhat) nostalgic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/d5a0cda09cdcf7bafa6eec8ecdd244c0.webp?t=1791306076\" width=1080 height=8 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made with pure passion by one person</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's been with me since my first  day in highschool, and stayed until graduation. Every single day spent on crafting as much of a creative experience as possible.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 / RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 / RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Reglan"],"publishers":["Reglan"],"release_date":"Oct 5, 2026"}